<title>USA: PECO sees Pa. nuke back on line Thursday.</title>
<headline>PECO sees Pa. nuke back on line Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>PECO Energy Co expects to have its 1,100 megawatt (MW) Peach Bottom 2 nuclear power station back on line Thursday, the company said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The unit was taken off line earlier Wednesday to correct a problem discovered as the unit was ramping up after a scheduled maintenance outage, said company spokesman Bill Jones.</p>
<p>&quot;We had a problem with the oil line to the generator. We expect it to be back on line some time tomorrow morning,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- H McCulloch + 1 212 859 1628</p>
</text>
